OL,3,AInfluencers hit back at criticism of   
OL,4,ADowning Street videos                  
OL,6,FSocial media influencers have hit back 
OL,7,Fat criticism of content filmed at an   
OL,8,Fevent in Downing Street with Andy      
OL,9,FBurnham, which critics said "demeaned" 
OL,10,FNumber 10.                             
OL,12,FMax Balegde, who posted a TikTok video 
OL,13,Fof himself miming to explicit lyrics   
OL,14,Foutside the front door of the PM's     
OL,15,Fofficial residence, apologised if any  
OL,16,Foffence had been caused.               
OL,18,FBut he blamed "revolting right wing    
OL,19,Fpeople" for stirring up controversy    
OL,20,Fabout it.                              
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
