OL,3,AInfluencers hit back at criticism of   
OL,4,ADowning Street videos                  
OL,6,FGovernment minister Bridget Phillipson 
OL,7,Fsaid Balegde's now deleted TikTok video
OL,8,Fhad been "totally unacceptable" but she
OL,9,Fsaid the prime minister was right to   
OL,10,Ftry to "reach people where they are" by
OL,11,Fengaging with influencers.             
